sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web Client
    participant API as API Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant Ext as Third-Party Service

    User->>Web: Submits form / Action
    Web->>API: POST /api/v1/resource (Payload)
    API->>API: Validate & Authenticate request
    API->>DB: Query current state
    DB-->>API: Return state
    API->>Ext: Invoke external integration (Sync)
    Ext-->>API: Return result / confirmation
    API->>DB: Persist updated state (Transaction)
    DB-->>API: Commit OK
    API-->>Web: 200 OK (Response JSON)
    Web-->>User: Display confirmation UI
